4375, 163.26849365234375], "inputs": [{"name": "", "link": 78, "type": "*"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "Reroute", "properties": {"horizontal": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showOutputText": false}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [83], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [203.62283325195312, 46], "pos": [3867.09765625, 430.0236511230469], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 37, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 79, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 46}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [58, 74], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [61], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [669.8624877929688, 1006.1698608398438], "pos": [935.0862426757812, 378.6917419433594], "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions\n<Subject 1>：兔耳少女，头戴精致彩绘面具，身着黑金刺绣长袍，红色腰带，白色长发。\n<Subject 2>：灰白条纹猫，头戴黑色斗笠，身穿黑色练功服，灰色条纹尾巴。\n<Picture 1>：女主角色参考图。\n<Picture 2>：男主角色参考图。\n<Picture 3>：女主武器，青色琵琶，带有金色花纹和青色光效。\n<Picture 4>：男主武器，黑色长剑，剑身有白色闪电纹路。\n<Picture 5>：打斗场景参考图，展示蓝绿色声波与黑白剑气碰撞的瞬间。\nsummary\n在幽深竹林中，男主持剑追杀怀抱琵琶的女主。女主转身质问后，以蓝绿色音波击碎男主黑白剑气，男主随即旋转跃起再次发起如海浪般的猛烈攻击。\nretention_analysis\n<Subject 1> fully_preserved\n<Subject 2> fully_preserved\n<Picture 3> fully_preserved\n<Picture 4> fully_preserved\n<Picture 5> attribute_transfer\ndetailed_description\n[Shot 1] 镜头在竹林中快速跟拍，<Subject 1> 怀抱 <Picture 3> 在林间小径的前面飞奔，衣摆随风飘动。<Subject 2> 手持 <Picture 4> 在<Subject 1> 身后紧追不舍，竹叶在两人奔跑的气流中纷飞。\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000 <Subject 1> 突然停止奔跑，转身面向 <Subject 2>，口型微动，在质问“到底是谁派你来的？”。<Subject 2> 随之停下脚步，气氛紧张。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000 <Subject 2> 瞬间发力，挥动 <Subject 4> 劈向<Subject 1> ，一道黑白色的凌厉剑气呼啸而出。<Subject 1> 迅速后退一步，手指拂过 <Subject 3> 的琴弦，一圈蓝绿色的声波荡漾开来，与黑白剑气猛烈碰撞，剑气瞬间被击溃。\n[Shot 4] At 00:12.000 <Subject 2> 借力跃起，在空中完成一个大旋转，再次高举 <Picture 4> 狠狠劈向<Subject 1> 。<Subject 1> 抬头迎战手指不断拂过 <Subject 3> 的琴弦，一圈圈蓝绿色的声波荡漾开来，抵挡住汹涌的黑白色剑气，画面定格于两股力量碰撞的瞬间\noverall_soundscape\n竹林的风声和竹叶的沙沙声，角色奔跑和跳跃的脚步声。剑刃破空的锐利声音，古琴拨弦的清脆之音，以及能量碰撞时产生的爆炸和碎裂声。\nnon_diegetic_music\n一段融合了传统民族乐器与现代电子音乐的紧张配乐，节奏随着追逐和打斗的场面由缓变急，在能量碰撞的瞬间达到高潮。", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 24, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 25, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 26, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 27, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 28, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "link": 29, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "link": 30, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_4", "link": 31, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_5", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "label": "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "ref_video_audio_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "link": 32, "label": "ref_audios.ref_audio_0", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_na